From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Make event tickets permanently distributable

Reference: pret/pokeemerald @ 5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038

Keep the original S.S. Tidal destination logic unchanged.

The existing Pokemon Center 2F Mystery Gift deliveryman is made permanently
visible and gives any missing event tickets. The ship-enable flags are set at
the moment each ticket is received because the original Emerald gift scripts
set the same flags and the unmodified harbor menu checks both item + flag.

No destination is force-unlocked, and no legendary encounter completion flag
is changed.

diff --git a/data/scripts/cable_club.inc b/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
--- a/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
+++ b/data/scripts/cable_club.inc
@@
 CableClub_EventScript_HideOrShowMysteryGiftMan::
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ShouldDistributeEonTicket
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, CableClub_EventScript_ShowMysteryGiftMan
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ValidateSavedWonderCard
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, CableClub_EventScript_HideMysteryGiftMan
-	goto CableClub_EventScript_ShowMysteryGiftMan
-	end
+	clearflag FLAG_HIDE_POKEMON_CENTER_2F_MYSTERY_GIFT_MAN
+	return
@@
 CableClub_EventScript_MysteryGiftMan::
-	specialvar VAR_RESULT, ShouldDistributeEonTicket
-	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, CableClub_EventScript_DistributeEonTicket
-	goto CableClub_EventScript_TryWonderCardScript
-	end
+	lock
+	faceplayer
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket
+	call PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap
+	msgbox gText_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift, MSGBOX_NPC
+	release
+	end
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_EON_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_EON_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_EON_TICKET
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_SOUTHERN_ISLAND
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveEonTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_AURORA_TICKET
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_BIRTH_ISLAND
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_AURORA_TICKET
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveAuroraTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket:
+	checkitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_MYSTIC_TICKET
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_NAVEL_ROCK
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_MYSTIC_TICKET
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveMysticTicket_Return:
+	return
+
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap:
+	checkitem ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, TRUE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return
+	checkitemspace ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return
+	giveitem ITEM_OLD_SEA_MAP
+	setflag FLAG_ENABLE_SHIP_FARAWAY_ISLAND
+	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_OLD_SEA_MAP
+PermanentExternalEvents_GiveOldSeaMap_Return:
+	return
